          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "mise à jour is a putting up to date. mise is the participle of mettre, from Latin mittere \"to send, to put\", and jour is inherited from Latin diurnum \"daily\" (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
